# Copy to `.env` (or `env`) on the trading VM and fill in. NEVER commit the filled-in file.
#
# The key must be SPOT trading only:
#   required  : Query Funds, Query Open/Closed Orders & Trades, Create & Cancel Orders
#   must NOT have: Withdraw Funds, Deposit Funds, Transfer Funds, Earn/Staking
#
# scripts/kraken.py refuses every funding endpoint before signing regardless of what the key
# is actually permitted to do (see FORBIDDEN), and scripts/guard_bash.py blocks them at the
# shell layer. Both are defence in depth -- the key itself should still be trade-only.

KRAKEN_API_KEY=your-kraken-api-key-here
KRAKEN_API_SECRET=your-kraken-api-secret-here
